1. Options Analysis Platforms
   Options Profit Calculator (optionsprofitcalculator.com)

   Allows you to simulate potential profits/losses for a variety of strike prices and expirations.
   You can input your assumptions (e.g., AAPL stock price movement, implied volatility, and expiration).
   Visualizes profit/loss in easy-to-read graphs.


2. OptionStrat (optionstrat.com)

   Provides advanced options strategies visualization tools.
   Lets you compare different strike prices and expirations with detailed breakdowns of risk/reward scenarios.
   Offers implied volatility and breakeven calculators.

3. Thinkorswim by TD Ameritrade:

   A professional trading platform with advanced options analysis tools.
   Offers "Risk Profile" tools for visualizing profit and loss for any strategy.
   Lets you backtest and simulate trades based on market conditions.
